# Gemini prompt & schema changes

Read `docs/features/gemini-llm.md` and `docs/API-INTEGRATION.md`. Use skill `.cursor/skills/change-gemini-prompt/`.

Checklist:

1. Update embedded prompt and `generationConfig` together
2. Grep `projects/popup`, `projects/dom-updater`, and `libs/llm-contract` for field names (`head`, `body`, `originalTitle`, etc.)
3. Update popup templates if adding/removing fields
4. `npm run build:extension` and manual test on a real PDP (`docs/TESTING-GUIDE.md`)
5. Update feature doc in same PR

Do not change model endpoint without verifying CSP `host_permissions` and `connect-src`.
